  "weightless": false,
  "leavesLetter": [],
  "purpose": "按三席具名理由得出实际授位结果，只有获授者可以亲口拒绝",
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l1",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "观里的灯燃过一夜，次晨你到含元殿核凭。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l2",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "次日，门槛的露水还没干。三席将封好的核凭摆上案，李和你同时起身。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l3",
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "支出办完了，三席各核了签，先读项再读名。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l4",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "先读项。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l5",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "殿上另设了女皇的御席。何太后移到监议的位置，案前留下两条进退的路。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l6",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_plan_pair": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "四处收了延期牒，两处代递收了首件。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l7",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_plan_pair": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "两处。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l8",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_plan_pair": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "核卷人随行，原案没复对。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l9",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_plan_budget": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "缩办的即期钱入账了，前后卷也核完了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l10",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_plan_budget": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "核完了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l11",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_plan_budget": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "新代递没开，缓办牒已送。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l12",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_plan_access": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "代递收了件，前后卷核完，余款已支去。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l13",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_plan_access": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "余款。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l14",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_plan_access": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "下月续费还没拨凭。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l15",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_plan_full": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "六处待扩办。原案附上，没换名目添钱。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l16",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_plan_full": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "原案。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l17",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_objection_public": true
      },
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "逐人回签在此，证人细节另封。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l18",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_objection_public": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l19",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_objection_public": true
      },
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "本轮没复对的，没盖已核。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l20",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_objection_deferred": true
      },
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "仍标待核，原件在封中。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l21",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_objection_deferred": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "待核。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l22",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_objection_deferred": true
      },
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "没回的签不代填，不能算核全。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l23",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_accept_3": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "柳的经手凭另附，你准合记的答复已录。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l24",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_accept_3": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "是。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l25",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_accept_3": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "摘要须更正，不能算亲核。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l26",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_refuse_3": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "柳的经手与总办并列，两项各有回签。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l27",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_refuse_3": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "并列。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l28",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_refuse_3": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "亲核之名没有借去。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l29",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "度支核账官将两份收支并排，手指停在拨款日期。唐照她签下的评语宣读。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l30",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_plan_pair": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "财政项支持{名}。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l31",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_plan_pair": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l32",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_plan_pair": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "缩办小了，即期钱到了；李案扩款待下月。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l33",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_plan_budget": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "财政项支持{名}。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l34",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_plan_budget": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l35",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_plan_budget": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "缩支足付本轮，李案即期钱还没全拨到。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l36",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_plan_access": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "财政项支持李令仪。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l37",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_plan_access": true
      },
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "财政项。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l38",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_plan_access": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "合署额度已准，{名}新增续费还没出处。"
    },
