        "flag.ch03_plan_full": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "六处还没开门，多画四处也不能多算。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l55",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "外署校案官把初稿与改稿分放，核证人的回签夹在两页当中。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s11_hanyuan.l56",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_plan_budget": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "纠错项支持{名}。"
    },
    {
